<%= pluralize(@messages.size, "inquiry") %> from the last 7 days <%= @messages.one? ? "was" : "were" %> added to New and linked to <%= @messages.one? ? "its" : "their" %> email <%= "thread".pluralize(@messages.size) %>.
Review and triage each lead in New:
<% @messages.each do |message| %>
<% lead = message.conversation.linkable if message.conversation.linkable.is_a?(Lead) %>

<%= (message.inbound_received_at || message.sent_at || message.created_at).in_time_zone.strftime("%b %-d") %> - <%= message.subject.presence || lead&.name.presence || "(no subject)" %>
<%= lead ? lead_url(lead) : inbox_thread_url(message.conversation) %>
<% end %>

Safety-net leads remain noted on Today during the 7-day lookback until triaged. Each inquiry is emailed only once.
